@dfreds/foundry-types

This package redistributes the Foundry VTT client type definitions maintained
by the Pathfinder Second Edition (pf2e) system for Foundry VTT.

    Copyright the pf2e system developers
    https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e

The original work is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. A copy of
that license is included in this distribution as LICENSE. This package is
distributed under the same license.

Modifications made to the original work:

  - The contents of `types/foundry/` in the pf2e repository were relocated to
    the root of this package. `client/`, `common/`, `global-external.d.mts` and
    `util.d.mts` are otherwise copied verbatim.
  - pf2e's `types/foundry/package.json` and `types/foundry/tsconfig.json` were
    not copied. This package supplies its own.
  - An `index.d.mts` entry point was added so the type definitions can be
    referenced as an npm package.
  - Any files under `patches/` in this package's source repository are applied
    on top of the copied definitions. Each patch records what it changes.

